<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">We received your request to cancel your application to Arizona State University, however we’re unable to process your request because your email does not match our records.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">You may request to cancel your application by logging in to <a href="https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">students.asu.edu/canceladmissions</a> with your ASURITE UserID and password. If your forgot your ASURITE ID or password, you may call the Help Desk at 480-965-6500 to reset your password.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you are unable to access the form, you may also email your request to <b><a href="mailto:decline@asu.edu">decline@asu.edu</a></b> using your email of record with ASU (the one you put on your application) or your offical asu.edu email address. You must include either your ASU ID number or date of birth (mm/dd/yy). This information verifies that we are canceling the correct application.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please contact your personal admission representative at <a href="http://asu.edu/findmyrep">asu.edu/findmyrep</a>. We wish you all the best.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><a href="http://www.asu.edu/">asu.edu</a></font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-size: medium; font-family: 'Times New Roman';"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>